  "title": "New 10% bonus to Cathay Pacific Asia Miles",
  "summary": "Cathay Pacific is offering a 10% bonus on transfers from US credit card and hotel programs through August 28, 2026. The bonus is capped at 10,000 miles and can take 12 weeks to post, but Asia Miles is the only realistic way to book most Cathay premium cabins, which is what makes this one worth a look.",
